<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-11T15:34:05.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:34:05 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative near the Lebanon border who was planning attacks for Iran, and also wounded six people in Lebanon in a separate attack. Houthi forces carried out a deadly strike on Saudi Arabia's Riyadh airport, prompting condemnation from Damascus. UN News reported intensified Israeli incursions in Syria alongside the ongoing conflict. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/10/uk-gaza-refugee-resettlement-scheme-palestinians-home-office&quot;&gt;theguardian.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5TVzRaQXdvUlo5MkVLd00zb1E2WWpDUERYczFHOXV5YlZNWEVSbFlJRnY0Q0xXS2tWb2lYSV90YW42VXNZYm9CZVM3eUxhaFdCbjBNUFhNNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
